{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LQm8JvKRQZ1794974324.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。</p><p></p><p>審訊踏入第40日，蔡天鳳前家翁鄺球繼續作供。他指案發當日下午收到長子鄺港傑電話，告知蔡天鳳沒有意識，鄺港智則在哭。他叫兒子駕車到大美督會合，鄺球之後看到蔡天鳳躺在車的地上，他檢查蔡天鳳的呼吸，又摸胸口發現沒有心跳，認為蔡天鳳已經沒有生命跡象，於是著大家回龍尾村單位集合。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI-1100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kREkUmKD5P1794974322.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他將蔡天鳳放入膠箱，並叫鄺港傑協助將膠箱搬入單位。鄺球指是他負責肢解蔡天鳳，與鄺港傑和鄺港智無關，但強調絕對無預謀殺死蔡天鳳。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:05:49.826966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T03:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:14.759952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:59:08.135101+00:00","content_hash":"0ac91cb2dbd77838e069a97ba6325a68f931ac5b604e61ba4ba15f7a4de61dac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:05:49.826966+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}